@API_ELEC_2_HostAddress = http://localhost:5027

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# kayo nalang po mag testing huhu ako sakit ulo na, btww anddyan  narin po yung format ng data na need niyo isend kada endpoint 
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET ALL EMPLOYEES
GET {{API_ELEC_2_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Accept: application/json

###

### GET EMPLOYEE BY ID
GET {{API_ELEC_2_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1
Accept: application/json

###

### CREATE EMPLOYEE
POST {{API_ELEC_2_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeID": 007,
  "firstName": "Ymmanuela Bo",
  "lastName": "Cabalquinto",
  "position": "Ewan basta",
  "birthDate": "2005-03-02"
}

###

### UPDATE EMPLOYEE
PUT {{API_ELEC_2_HostAddress}}/api/employees/100
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Richard",
  "lastName": "Peralta",
  "position": "Senior Dev",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-15"
}

###

### DELETE EMPLOYEE
DELETE {{API_ELEC_2_HostAddress}}/api/employees/100
Accept: application/json

###


